  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farmers in East Shewa and West Arsi Zone of Oromia and Northern Zone and Hawassa of Sidama in Ethiopia will engage with local CSOs to support SMCs/PTAs, farmer training centres, agriculture extension and mother support groups to mobilize local communities to plan, establish and manage school/community gardens and climate resilient food production activities. It will support youth, women, farmer groups, and cooperatives to diversify incomes and increase participation within local value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
